ener Center Study Lounges","subtitle":"Havener Center","notes":"Use Havener’s distributed study lounges when you need either an individual quiet area or a group-oriented setting without leaving the student center.","short_summary":"Individual and group study areas throughout Havener.","evidence_claim":"Havener Center states that quiet individual study areas and group study spaces are available throughout the building.","source_url":"https://havener.mst.edu/services/study-lounges/","source_title":"Study Lounges – Havener Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For a study group using an available meeting room, ask the Information Desk or Events and Hospitality Management; groups cannot reserve such space in advance and must have at least three people.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mst-innovation-lab-collaboration-study-spaces","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Innovation Lab Collaboration and Study Spaces","title":"Innovation Lab Collaboration and Study Spaces","subtitle":"Innovation Lab","notes":"Bring a partner or project team to the Innovation Lab’s collaboration and group-study spaces, which sit alongside makers, active-learning, and support environments.","short_summary":"Collaborative and individual study settings in the Innovation Lab.","evidence_claim":"Missouri S&T says the Innovation Lab includes spaces for collaboration and for group and individual study.","source_url":"https://news.mst.edu/2024/02/look-inside-sts-new-innovation-lab/","source_title":"Look inside S&T’s new Innovation Lab","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-02-15","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Missouri S&T reports that all S&T students can access the Innovation Lab to collaborate on projects, study, or relax; check building acces